## DISABLED 2026-11-18: strawberry tracks master, so nearly every nxup bumped
## it and paid for a full build here before the rebuild (twice whenever the
## channel moved too). nxmanifest only verifies when verify.nix exists —
## rename this back to verify.nix to re-enable.
##
## Post-refresh build check for nxmanifest (same contract as packages/krema):
## `nix-build verify.nix` must succeed before a manifest bump is accepted.
## pkgs.callPackage, as in system/packages.nix, so the rebuild reuses it.
let
    pkgs = import <nixpkgs> { config.allowUnfree = true; };
in
    pkgs.callPackage ./. { }

